# Cinema View MVP does not require any environment variables.
# `npm run build` and `npm run start` work out of the box without a `.env` file.
#
# Optional: set a canonical site URL for production metadata (`metadataBase`,
# `robots.txt`, and `sitemap.xml`). When omitted, the app falls back to
# `VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL`, `VERCEL_URL`, or `http://localhost:3000`.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://cinema-view.example.com
